  unitName: Alphie
  unitId: 830827
  unitNumber: 8599
  description: "Emperor Yu had to admit\u2014his immortal existence was honestly
    getting a little tiresome, even if his domain of Heaven was a pleasant place
    filled with benevolent souls. That was how a competition among twelve creature
    families was drawn up to select the most capable to serve as his assistant, but
    for a few of the candidates, the human realm seemed much more fascinating than
    the prospect of divine duty.Goat was a scrappy little thing, but what he lacked
    in stature, he more than made up with sincere effort. Always sparing a thought
    for less sure-footed friends, Goat was adept at leading others through the precarious
    mountain paths he navigated with ease. Only Tiger could possibly compete, but
    even so, Goat was uncontested in merely walking up the sheerest of cliffs.When
    Goat stepped into the human realm and looked upon the alpine mountains, a wave
    of nostalgia rocked him to his very soul. Had he not walked these same paths
    in the world before he had ascended?His appearance subconsciously drew from the
    folklore of the region, and soon, whispers spread among the villages that an
    \"elfin fairy\" had come to live among them. The gentle swing of his lantern-slung
    cane became a beacon of hope for those who had gotten lost in the mist-filled
    valleys. His raggedly hat, topped with the curved horns of the mountain's four-legged
    natives, led many to call this benevolent little creature Alphie.Pleased with
    his new name, Alphie shouldered his knapsack full of odds and ends and toddled
    off. They'd never know where he got them from..."
  summonDesc: Ya look like ya need a hand! <br>Hey, what's with that look? <br>I
    may be small, but betcha can't find anyone else hereabouts ta help!
  fusionDesc: Hey now! A mighty fine addition to this here collection!<br>Betcha
    it'll come in handy when ya least expect.
